OL,3,GNEWSA'My big breasts lead to lewd
OL,4,Acomments in the street'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBack pain, rashes, harassment from
OL,7,Fstrangers in the street and a bad
OL,8,Fsmell.
OL,10,FThese are just some of the reasons why
OL,11,FCharlotte Howard, 52, says she is
OL,12,F"disgusted" by her own breasts.
OL,14,FOnce measuring at a 32B, they soon grew
OL,15,Fto a 40GG when she put on weight as she
OL,16,Fstarted the menopause, meaning she gets
OL,17,Flewd comments directed at her.
OL,19,F"I find them intolerable. I'm basically
OL,20,Fcarrying half a stone off my neck and
OL,21,Fshoulders. I can't look at myself
OL,22,Fwithout clothes on," she says.
